Recommends: msi-keyboard
Description: GTK4 lighting manager for MSI SteelSeries 3-zone keyboards
 MSIKey controls the RGB backlight zones on MSI SteelSeries 3-zone
 keyboards (USB 1770:ff00, as found in MSI GT/GE/GS laptops). It replaces
 hand-typed msi-keyboard commands and systemd units with a GUI: pick a
 colour and brightness per zone, choose an animation or build a custom
 keyframe sequence, save profiles, and re-apply lighting automatically
 at login.
 .
 Talks straight to /dev/hidrawN alongside the in-kernel gt683r_led
 driver; no libusb detach and no root needed once the bundled udev rule
 is installed.
